Copyright 2026 the repository authors

This repository vendors, unmodified, the reference implementation of

    Learning Agile Robotic Locomotion Skills by Imitating Animals
    Xue Bin Peng, Erwin Coumans, Tingnan Zhang, Tsang-Wei Lee, Jie Tan, Sergey Levine
    Robotics: Science and Systems (RSS) 2020
    https://xbpeng.github.io/projects/Robotic_Imitation/index.html

as `third_party/motion_imitation/`, taken from

    https://github.com/erwincoumans/motion_imitation  (commit 2f206ab)

That code, together with the motion clips (`data/motions/*.txt`) and the
pretrained policies (`data/policies/*.zip`) shipped with it, is licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (see `LICENSE.txt`). All modifications, additions and
the analysis in `src/`, `docs/`, `tests/` and `scripts/` are released under the
same license.

Nothing in `third_party/` has been edited: every behavioural change of this
repository is applied at run time by `src/env_patch.py`, so the reference
implementation can always be used as a bit-exact baseline.
